          Most air fryers are the same machine in different plastic: a heater, a fan and a basket. What separates a good one from a drawer-filler is shape, capacity and how easily it cleans. We narrowed the field to seven models that cover small kitchens, big families and anyone who wants to retire the toaster oven.
