            These seven picks are drawn from manufacturer specifications, long-running owner feedback and how each design suits a particular kitchen; we have not bench-tested them for this guide. Links on this page are affiliate links, so if you buy through them we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you, and that never changes where a model ranks. Prices change daily, so click through for the current figure.
          </p>

          {PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => (
            <div id={product.id} class="scroll-mt-24 mt-12 first:mt-8">
              <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <div class="bg-gray-900 px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
